{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PROFIT OR PERIL is a 1\u20134 player co-op extraction horror. Slip into shifting spaces, solve puzzles to open routes, grab valuables, and get out alive. No quota timer\u2014your progress is what you bring home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORK TOGETHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>Stay close to be heard: 3D positional voice makes whispers safer than shouts. Enemies can hear you. Split roles on the fly\u2014solver, lookout, runner, decoy\u2014and keep each other alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOLVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong> Keys and routes are earned, not found. Environmental puzzles gate access, reward coordination, and punish mistakes with noise and risk.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXTRACT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong> Haul slows you down. If the team wipes, the haul is gone; if you escape, you bank the profit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROGRESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong> Start on Level One. Use in-game earnings to unlock deeper, stranger locations and push your luck further.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THREATS &amp; STEALTH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong> Noise, light, and sightlines matter. Most dangers are best avoided, baited, or outrun.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946080?t=1755908672","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946080/9ee70f7f6ad661d3a7bf6db0d170369f3ca70c6a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755908672","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946080/33b153b2876d95115f9b0572f0b3717b50d72b01/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755908672","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946080/33b153b2876d95115f9b0572f0b3717b50d72b01/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755908672","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Full controller support",